Also, AAP/AWX does **not** currently have a simple built-in “download arbitrary generated file from the job results page” experience, so the common practical pattern is either:
- print the result into the **job output**, or
- write/publish the file somewhere explicit and reachable. [3](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_ansible_automation_platform/2.7)

